---
import Layout from "../../components/Layout.astro";
import SavingsQuickLinks from "../../components/SavingsQuickLinks.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="도시가스 요금 계산기 (난방비·취사비)"
  description="계량기 사용량(m³)의 열량(MJ) 변환, 주택용 난방·취사 단가, 기본료, 부가세를 반영한 도시가스 청구금액을 실시간 정확히 모의 계산해요."
>
  <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-3xl px-4 py-8 sm:px-8">
    <div class="mb-6">
      <a href="/" class="text-xs font-semibold text-muted-foreground hover:text-primary transition-colors mb-3 inline-block">← 전체 도구 목록</a>
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-primary/20 bg-primary/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-primary mb-3">
          한국가스공사 공식 열량단가 규정 반영
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-foreground">
          도시가스 요금 계산기 (난방비 · 취사)
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
          계량기 사용량(m³)을 평균발열량(42.8 MJ/m³)으로 환산하여 주택용 난방·취사 요금 및 부가세를 산출해요.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card -->
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6 shadow-sm mb-8 space-y-6">
        <div>
          <label class="text-xs font-bold text-foreground block mb-2">가스 공급 용도</label>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
            <label class="flex items-center gap-2 p-3 rounded-lg border border-border cursor-pointer hover:bg-muted/50 transition-colors has-[:checked]:border-primary has-[:checked]:bg-primary/5">
              <input type="radio" name="usageType" value="heating" checked class="text-primary" />
              <div>
                <span class="text-xs font-bold text-foreground block">주택용 난방 (개별난방)</span>
                <span class="text-[11px] text-muted-foreground">22.15 원/MJ (보일러 난방+온수)</span>
              </div>
            </label>
            <label class="flex items-center gap-2 p-3 rounded-lg border border-border cursor-pointer hover:bg-muted/50 transition-colors has-[:checked]:border-primary has-[:checked]:bg-primary/5">
              <input type="radio" name="usageType" value="cooking" class="text-primary" />
              <div>
                <span class="text-xs font-bold text-foreground block">주택용 취사 (가스레인지)</span>
                <span class="text-[11px] text-muted-foreground">21.05 원/MJ (취사 전용)</span>
              </div>
            </label>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-1.5">
            <label for="usageM3" class="text-sm font-bold text-foreground">이번 달 사용량 (m³)</label>
            <span class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">계량기 당월지침 - 전월지침</span>
          </div>
          <input
            type="number"
            id="usageM3"
            value="50"
            min="0"
            step="1"
            class="w-full rounded-lg border border-input bg-background px-3 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-foreground focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary"
          />
        </div>

        <!-- Presets -->
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs">
          <button type="button" class="preset-btn px-2.5 py-1 bg-muted hover:bg-muted/80 rounded text-foreground font-medium transition-colors" data-val="10">취사 전용 (10 m³)</button>
          <button type="button" class="preset-btn px-2.5 py-1 bg-muted hover:bg-muted/80 rounded text-foreground font-medium transition-colors" data-val="30">1인 가구 봄/가을 (30 m³)</button>
          <button type="button" class="preset-btn px-2.5 py-1 bg-muted hover:bg-muted/80 rounded text-foreground font-medium transition-colors" data-val="70">4인 가구 난방 (70 m³)</button>
          <button type="button" class="preset-btn px-2.5 py-1 bg-muted hover:bg-muted/80 rounded text-foreground font-medium transition-colors" data-val="120">겨울 집중난방 (120 m³)</button>
        </div>

        <!-- Result Summary -->
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-primary/30 bg-primary/5 p-5 space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between border-b border-primary/20 pb-3">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-primary">예상 청구금액</span>
            <div class="text-right">
              <span id="resTotalBilled" class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-foreground">0</span>
              <span class="text-xs font-bold text-muted-foreground ml-1">원</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-2 text-xs">
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <span class="text-muted-foreground">환산 소비 열량 (MJ)</span>
              <span id="resEnergyMJ" class="font-semibold text-foreground">0 MJ</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <span class="text-muted-foreground">기본요금 (월정액)</span>
              <span class="font-semibold text-foreground">1,000 원</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <span class="text-muted-foreground">가스 사용요금</span>
              <span id="resUsageCharge" class="font-semibold text-foreground">0 원</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <span class="text-muted-foreground">부가가치세 (10%)</span>
              <span id="resVat" class="font-semibold text-foreground">0 원</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- API Box -->
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-muted/40 p-5 text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-8">
        <p class="font-bold text-foreground mb-1">api.oiyo.net B2A 무비용 연동 엔드포인트</p>
        <p class="mb-2">에너지 시뮬레이션 및 가스 요금 계산 API를 무료로 직접 호출할 수 있어요.</p>
        <code class="block rounded bg-background p-2.5 font-mono text-[11px] text-foreground border border-border break-all">
          GET https://api.oiyo.net/v1/energy/kr/gas-bill?usageM3=50&type=heating
        </code>
      </div>

      <SavingsQuickLinks ids={["energy-voucher", "energy-cashback", "bokjiro"]} heading="난방비 줄이는 공식 지원 제도" />

      <div class="mt-8 rounded-lg border border-border bg-muted/30 p-4 text-center text-xs text-muted-foreground">
        © {new Date().getFullYear()} Oiyo Tech · 한국가스공사 및 도시가스 공급규정 준수
      </div>

    <script>
      const AVG_CALORIFIC = 42.8;
      const HEATING_RATE = 22.15;
      const COOKING_RATE = 21.05;
      const BASE_FEE = 1000;

      function updateGasCalc() {
        const usageInput = document.getElementById('usageM3') as HTMLInputElement;
        const typeInput = document.querySelector('input[name="usageType"]:checked') as HTMLInputElement;

        const m3 = Math.max(0, Number(usageInput.value) || 0);
        const isCooking = typeInput && typeInput.value === 'cooking';
        const unitPrice = isCooking ? COOKING_RATE : HEATING_RATE;

        const energyMJ = Number((m3 * AVG_CALORIFIC).toFixed(1));
        const usageCharge = Math.floor(energyMJ * unitPrice);
        const supply = BASE_FEE + usageCharge;
        const vat = Math.floor(supply * 0.1);
        const totalBilled = Math.floor((supply + vat) / 10) * 10;

        document.getElementById('resEnergyMJ')!.textContent = energyMJ.toLocaleString('ko-KR') + ' MJ';
        document.getElementById('resUsageCharge')!.textContent = usageCharge.toLocaleString('ko-KR') + ' 원';
        document.getElementById('resVat')!.textContent = vat.toLocaleString('ko-KR') + ' 원';
        document.getElementById('resTotalBilled')!.textContent = totalBilled.toLocaleString('ko-KR');
      }

      document.getElementById('usageM3')?.addEventListener('input', updateGasCalc);
      document.querySelectorAll('input[name="usageType"]').forEach(r => r.addEventListener('change', updateGasCalc));

      document.querySelectorAll('.preset-btn').forEach(btn => {
        btn.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
          const val = (e.currentTarget as HTMLElement).getAttribute('data-val');
          if (val) {
            (document.getElementById('usageM3') as HTMLInputElement).value = val;
            updateGasCalc();
          }
        });
      });

      updateGasCalc();
    </script>
  </div>
</Layout>
